// Tossbox dashboard <-> node agent protocol.
//
// Model: the dashboard owns the DESIRED state of every device; the agent owns
// the ACTUAL state. The agent keeps one long-lived bidirectional stream open
// (NodeControl.Connect, outbound from the node). On (re)connect the dashboard
// sends the full desired state of that node (Welcome); afterwards it sends
// incremental ApplyDevice / DeleteDevice messages. The agent reconciles and
// reports DeviceStatus whenever the actual state changes.
//
// Security: Enrollment.Enroll is called over TLS with the dashboard CA pinned
// (fingerprint contained in the enrollment token) and authenticated by the
// one-time token. NodeControl.Connect requires mTLS with the issued client cert.

